トで可愛いです！\n次のリクエストですが、またナズーリンを描いていただけませんか？\nその際は、エキゾチックダンサー姿のナズーリンをお願いします！\n構図はお任せします！\nいつもありがとうございます！\n\nHello!\nThank you very much for the wonderful Nazrin illustration!\nNazrin always looks very cute and pretty!\nFor my next request, would you be interested in drawing Nazrin again?\nIf so, please draw her in an exotic dancer outfit!\nI'll leave the composition up to you!\nThank you very much always!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tmtmdsy/works/15", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/b00000fc/uploads/origins/0e579db0-5f38-45d3-842e-202504cce043?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=48eeff489fdd0f497d0c0a35e158975a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/b00000fc/uploads/origins/0e579db0-5f38-45d3-842e-202504cce043?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=48eeff489fdd0f497d0c0a35e158975a, https://si.imgix.net/b00000fc/uploads/origins/0e579db0-5f38-45d3-842e-202504cce043?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c2f946a86a4b22e1ebf34c0d79333d4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/b00000fc/uploads/origins/0e579db0-5f38-45d3-842e-202504cce043?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d2d131b588478f2580b65a04f708f029 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "Hello,\nThank you very much for the previous illustration!\nNazrin looked really cute and the theme was really interesting!\nFor my next request, please draw Nazrin again in any situation you wish!\nI’ll leave everything up to you!\nThank you!\n\nこんにちは、\n前回のイラスト、ありがとうございました！\nナズーリンがとても可愛くて、テーマもとても面白かったです！\n次回のリクエストは、また好きなシチュエーションでナズーリンを描いてください！\n全てお任せします！\nありがとうございました", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@tmtmdsy/works/14", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/19f46ae5/uploads/origins/cd520484-000f-4d35-b5f2-3d6a47a25672?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7e257fa622cea08b32bc76b36e1d2cdf", "thumbnail_s